id: pm-weky
title: Certify pm-presets on PM CLI SDK 2026.9.28 and current published release helpers
description: "Upgrade the exact installed PM CLI SDK, pm-ops and pm-changelog dependencies from the published registry; verify the canonical merge-driver launcher, package activation, full local release gate and packed npm/Bun acceptance. Keep all-source quality and review limitations explicit."
type: Chore
status: blocked
priority: 1
tags[6]: bun,certify,npm,pm-changelog,pm-cli-2026.9.28,pm-ops
created_at: "2026-09-28T22:37:53.097Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-02T23:22:39.323Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "Manifest and lockfile resolve published PM CLI SDK 2026.9.28, pm-ops 2026.9.28, and pm-changelog 2026.9.25; launcher is byte-identical to the installed published template; strict PM health and full release:check pass with measured tests, skips, coverage scope and audit results; a packed archive installs and activates in fresh npm/Node and Bun projects; exact pushed head, GitHub CI and bot review state are recorded without treating absent reviews as approval."
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-02T23:22:14.714Z",codex-sol-land,"Resumed PR #109 from e6d8bb6c204112fc248310ab8be7128d804ce220. Rebase onto current main yields e6d8bb6c204112fc248310ab8be7128d804ce220. All existing bot artifacts and restart-era owner replies inspected; no new actionable finding. Preserve earlier fixes and technical refusals. Verifying unchanged CI gates under the shared heavy lock; no merge, release or closure."
  "2026-10-02T23:22:38.271Z",codex-sol-land,"Resumed verification: npm ci, current-base rebase, fresh committed-dist comparison, strict local tracker health with required merge drivers, npm run release:check, and bun install --no-save all passed. Full gate: 152 tests, 152 pass, 0 skips; configured coverage thresholds unchanged. PM-linked tests/release-workflow.test.ts passed. Earlier findings and technical refusals retained; no new source fix was needed in this restart. Exact pushed-head CI and substantive reviewer availability remain separate checks; no merge, release, publication or item closure."
notes[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-28T22:45:09.152Z","harness:codex","During SDK surface investigation, a read-intended config probe accidentally invoked pm config project set id-prefix sample- in this checkout. It was immediately restored with pm config project set id-prefix pm-. Strict health passed afterward. The two append-only _workspace events are retained, and settings.json differs only by canonical JSON key order. This is inspection evidence, not a package behavior change."
  "2026-09-28T22:48:16.803Z","harness:codex","Candidate local gate after exact published pins passed 151/151, zero failures/skips; 16 declared source files at 100% lines/branches/functions, 93/93 documented declarations, zero production npm vulnerabilities, pack/changelog/provenance checks passed. It does not measure statements or cover every executable script; pm-915f remains open. Packed npm/Node and Bun 1.3.5 projects both installed and activated seven presets and validated them. Applying agent-workflow made preset diff inSync=true but strict health failed with settings.json history drift in both; Bun also has independent five-driver drift on fresh CLI-only init. Package issue pm-1vx6 and upstream pm-cli #1345/#1346 block certification. The initial combined npm install returned a transient E404 while separate explicit published-version installs succeeded. A read-intended id-prefix config probe changed this checkout and was restored via the CLI; append-only audit entries are retained as recorded in the earlier note."
  "2026-09-28T22:49:20.234Z","harness:codex","Private companion owner reference: pm-cli-website-5s6z. The companion records the package PR, hosted boundaries, and imported upstream issues; no private companion contents are copied into this public package."
  "2026-09-28T22:56:26.107Z","harness:codex","Greptile review on PR 109 identified the broken pm-ops install branch without a fixture. Added a real child-process checkout test for a package directory without package.json and for a dangling pm-ops symlink; both must fail with MODULE_NOT_FOUND and register no drivers. The full release:check passed on the amended candidate with 152 tests. Settings-history and Bun strict-health defects remain open."
